TMadeAlex brand-assets - what the licences cover

A draft, set up for TMade Alex as a gift by Christopher W (@drasticstatic), a
member of his community. It is not legal advice, and no lawyer has reviewed it.

1. TMade Alex's own work: all rights reserved.
   The TRADERMADE wordmark, his TRADERMADE art and his photographs are TMade
   Alex's. All rights in them are reserved to him. They sit outside every
   licence named in this file: no licence is granted to copy, redistribute,
   modify, publish or sell them without TMade Alex's prior written permission.
   On the main branch there is no copy of any of them. A copy of his art waits
   on a separate branch that has not been published; PROVENANCE.md lists each
   file with where it came from and when.

2. His names and marks.
   TRADERMADE, TMade, TMade Alex, TMADE and TMadeAlex are covered by
   TRADEMARKS.md, not by any licence here.

3. What the gift made.
   The written pages in this repository and the two drawn banners
   (assets/banner.svg, banner/banner.svg) were made by Christopher W and his
   helpers from the drasticstatic lab's public templates, which are MIT
   licensed (https://github.com/drasticstatic/my-template). They may be copied
   and changed on the same terms. The colours in them are sampled from TMade
   Alex's art; using the colours grants no right in his marks.

4. The icons.
   The icons in assets/icons/ are from Lucide, under the ISC licence. See
   assets/icons/LICENSE.
